{"id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:regular-level-set-hypersurface","title":"prop:regular-level-set-hypersurface","path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.md","line":1175,"body":"","kind":"theorem","status":"not_started","tex":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex#prop:regular-level-set-hypersurface","uses":["[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixA#prop:regular-level-set-hypersurface-codim-one]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:regular-set]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:regular-set-open]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:regular-restrict-regular-value]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex","label":"prop:regular-level-set-hypersurface","line":1912,"source":"\\begin{proposition}\n\\label{prop:regular-level-set-hypersurface}\n\n\\uses{prop:regular-level-set-hypersurface-codim-one, def:regular-set, lem:regular-set-open, lem:regular-restrict-regular-value}\n\n\n\n\\dcref{ch2:2.37}\n\nLet $M$ be a smooth $(n+1)$-manifold without boundary, let\n$f\\in C^\\infty(M)$, and let $\\mathcal R$ be the regular set of $f$. For every\n$c\\in\\mathbb R$, the set\n\\[\nM_c=f^{-1}(c)\\cap\\mathcal R\n\\]\nis a smooth $n$-manifold.\n\\end{proposition}\n\n\\begin{proof}\n\n\\uses{prop:regular-level-set-hypersurface-codim-one,lem:regular-restrict-regular-value,lem:regular-set-open}\n\\sketch The open set $\\mathcal R$ is an $(n+1)$-manifold, and $c$ is a regular value\nof $f|_{\\mathcal R}$. Apply Proposition\n\\ref{prop:regular-level-set-hypersurface-codim-one} to obtain the smooth\n$n$-manifold $(f|_{\\mathcal R})^{-1}(c)$.\n\\end{proof}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proposition</div></section> <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-70726f703a726567756c61722d6c6576656c2d7365742d687970657273757266616365\"></span> <p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FappendixA%23prop%3Aregular-level-set-hypersurface-codim-one\">↗ prop:regular-level-set-hypersurface-codim-one</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Aregular-set\">↗ def:regular-set</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Aregular-set-open\">↗ lem:regular-set-open</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Aregular-restrict-regular-value\">↗ lem:regular-restrict-regular-value</a> <p></p><span class=\"tex-source-references\" role=\"list\" style=\"display:block\"><span class=\"tex-dcref\" role=\"listitem\" style=\"display:block\">1. ch2:2.37</span></span><p></p>Let <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$M$\">$M$</span> be a smooth <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$(n+1)$\">$(n+1)$</span>-manifold without boundary, let <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$f\\in C^\\infty (M)$\">$f\\in C^\\infty (M)$</span>, and let <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\mathcal R$\">$\\mathcal R$</span> be the regular set of <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$f$\">$f$</span>. For every <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$c\\in \\mathbb R$\">$c\\in \\mathbb R$</span>, the set <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\[  M_c=f^{-1}(c)\\cap \\mathcal R  \\]\">\\[  M_c=f^{-1}(c)\\cap \\mathcal R  \\]</span> is a smooth <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$n$\">$n$</span>-manifold.  <p></p><section class=\"theorem proof\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proof</div><p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FappendixA%23prop%3Aregular-level-set-hypersurface-codim-one\">↗ prop:regular-level-set-hypersurface-codim-one</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Aregular-restrict-regular-value\">↗ lem:regular-restrict-regular-value</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Aregular-set-open\">↗ lem:regular-set-open</a> \\sketch The open set <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\mathcal R$\">$\\mathcal R$</span> is an <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$(n+1)$\">$(n+1)$</span>-manifold, and <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$c$\">$c$</span> is a regular value of <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$f|_{\\mathcal R}$\">$f|_{\\mathcal R}$</span>. Apply Proposition <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FappendixA%23prop%3Aregular-level-set-hypersurface-codim-one\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixA#prop:regular-level-set-hypersurface-codim-one\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-70726f703a726567756c61722d6c6576656c2d7365742d6879706572737572666163652d636f64696d2d6f6e65\">prop:regular-level-set-hypersurface-codim-one</a> to obtain the smooth <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$n$\">$n$</span>-manifold <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$(f|_{\\mathcal R})^{-1}(c)$\">$(f|_{\\mathcal R})^{-1}(c)$</span>. </p><span class=\"qed\" aria-label=\"证毕\" style=\"display:block;text-align:right\">□</span></section>","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: sketch"]},"previous":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:regular-restrict-regular-value","next":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:regular-part-image","relations":[{"ki